{"step_index":584,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:21:18Z","thinking":"Initial list analysis is complete; identifying why each entry failed the initial search is the next step. For example, \"피커스튜디오\" directly yields \"주식회사 피커스튜디오\" (`606-16-43962`) in a Bizno search. This clarifies that the issue isn't the presence of the business but the search term used, and further analysis is needed to reveal any similar discrepancies.\n\n\nIdentifying specific business information like CEO names, and matching subsidiary/branch entries with parent company business registration numbers is essential. Analyzing entries like \"영풍문고 신세계 센텀시티점\" reveals that the search term might need to be adjusted to the parent company, \"주식회사 영풍문고\". This confirms that direct matching based on the exact search term is frequently insufficient, and an understanding of business relationships is required.\n\n\nThe next step is to process each company name, address, and related information, using both web search and business database lookup tools. Variations in the company names (e.g., presence of \"(Dowon E&I)\") require handling different search term combinations to ensure comprehensive retrieval. Address-based search queries will be utilized where available to confirm location data and cross-validate findings.\n\n\nThe process will now involve developing a combined search and business database verification script, tested incrementally. Focusing initially on readily solvable company groups will expedite process familiarization. These groups include branches/affiliates of large corporations, startups within specific business complexes, companies with clear names/CEOs, and individual-operated businesses. The strategy involves batch processing and verifying each group's information systematically across multiple sources.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import json\nimport urllib.request\nimport urllib.parse\nimport re\nimport sys\n\nsys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding='utf-8')\n\nHEADERS = {\n    \"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\"\n}\n\ndef search_bizno_exact(keyword):\n    \"\"\"Search bizno with clean keyword and return first few valid articles\"\"\"\n    url = f\"https://bizno.net/?query={urllib.parse.quote(keyword.strip())}\"\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=HEADERS)\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=5) as resp:\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n    except Exception as e:\n        return []\n        \n    if '<div class=\"col-lg-4 sidebar\">' in html:\n        main_content = html.split('<div class=\"col-lg-4 sidebar\">')[0]\n    else:\n        main_content = html\n        \n    posts = re.findall(r'<div class=\"single-post[\\s\\S]*?(?=<div class=\"single-post|<hr>|$)', main_content)\n    results = []\n    seen = set()\n    for p in posts:\n        art_match = re.search(r'href=[\"\\']/article/(\\d{10})[\"\\']', p)\n        if not art_match: continue\n        art_id = art_match.group(1)\n        if art_id in seen: continue\n        seen.add(art_id)\n        \n        title_match = re.search(r'<h[34][^>]*>(.*?)</h[34]>', p)\n        title = re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', '', title_match.group(1)).strip() if title_match else \"\"\n        \n        p_match = re.search(r'<p>([\\s\\S]*?)</p>', p)\n        addr_snip = re.sub(r'\\s+', ' ', re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', '', p_match.group(1))).strip() if p_match else \"\"\n        \n        results.append({\n            \"biz_no_10\": art_id,\n            \"title\": title,\n            \"addr_snip\": addr_snip\n        })\n    return results\n\ndef get_bizno_detail(biz_no_10):\n    url = f\"https://bizno.net/article/{biz_no_10}\"\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=HEADERS)\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=5) as resp:\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n            \n            desc_match = re.search(r'<meta\\s+name=[\"\\']description[\"\\']\\s+content=[\"\\'](.*?)[\"\\']', html)\n            desc = desc_match.group(1) if desc_match else \"\"\n            \n            title_match = re.search(r'<title>(.*?)</title>', html)\n            title = title_match.group(1).replace(\"- 비즈노\", \"\").strip() if title_match else \"\"\n            \n            ceo_match = re.search(r'대표자명\\s*:\\s*([^\\s<]+)', desc)\n            ceo = ceo_match.group(1).strip() if ceo_match else \"\"\n            \n            est_match = re.search(r'설립일[^\\:]*:\\s*(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})', desc)\n            est_year = int(est_match.group(1)) if est_match else \"\"\n            est_month = int(est_match.group(2)) if est_match else \"\"\n            \n            emp_match = re.search(r'종업원수\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)명', desc)\n            emp_cnt = int(emp_match.group(1)) if emp_match else \"\"\n            \n            biz_match = re.search(r'사업자등록번호\\s*:\\s*(\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5})', desc)\n            biz_no = biz_match.group(1) if biz_match else f\"{biz_no_10[:3]}-{biz_no_10[3:5]}-{biz_no_10[5:]}\"\n            \n            tel_match = re.search(r'전화번호\\s*:\\s*([0-9\\-]+)', desc)\n            tel = tel_match.group(1).strip() if tel_match else \"\"\n            \n            fax_match = re.search(r'팩스번호\\s*:\\s*([0-9\\-]+)', desc)\n            fax = fax_match.group(1).strip() if fax_match else \"\"\n            \n            addr_match = re.search(r'회사주소\\s*:\\s*(.*?)(?=\\s+(?:종업원수|사업자등록번호|법인등록번호|홈페이지|통신판매업번호|$))', desc)\n            if not addr_match:\n                addr_match = re.search(r'소재지\\s*</th>\\s*<td[^>]*>(.*?)</td>', html)\n            addr = addr_match.group(1).strip() if addr_match else \"\"\n            addr = re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', ' ', addr).strip()\n            \n            status_match = re.search(r'사업자 현재 상태[^\\:]*:\\s*([^\\s<]+)', desc)\n            status = status_match.group(1) if status_match else \"\"\n            \n            closed_match = re.search(r'폐업일자\\s*:\\s*(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})', html) or re.search(r'폐업일자\\s*:\\s*(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})', desc)\n            closed_date = closed_match.group(1) if closed_match else \"\"\n            \n            return {\n                \"biz_no_10\": biz_no_10,\n                \"biz_no\": biz_no,\n                \"title\": title,\n                \"ceo\": ceo,\n                \"est_year\": est_year,\n                \"est_month\": est_month,\n                \"emp_cnt\": emp_cnt,\n                \"tel\": tel,\n                \"fax\": fax,\n                \"addr\": addr,\n                \"status\": status,\n                \"closed_date\": closed_date\n            }\n    except:\n        return None\n\n# Test target cases\ntest_targets = [\n    (\"피커스튜디오\", [\"피커스튜디오\", \"피커 스튜디오\"]),\n    (\"유티플러스인터랙티브\", [\"유티플러스인터랙티브\", \"유티플러스\"]),\n    (\"시드게임즈\", [\"시드게임즈\", \"시드 게임즈\"]),\n    (\"와이즈온미디어 주식회사\", [\"와이즈온미디어\"]),\n    (\"주식회사 도원이앤아이(Dowon E&I)\", [\"도원이앤아이\", \"도원 이앤아이\"]),\n    (\"헤윰아이씨티\", [\"헤윰아이씨티\", \"헤윰\"]),\n    (\"스튜디오비오\", [\"스튜디오비오\", \"스튜디오 비오\"]),\n    (\"하드롤게임즈\", [\"하드롤게임즈\", \"하드롤\"]),\n    (\"운도게임스튜디오\", [\"운도게임스튜디오\", \"운도\"]),\n    (\"한국가이던스부산지사\", [\"한국가이던스\"]),\n    (\"케이엘정보통신 주식회사 부산지점\", [\"케이엘정보통신\"]),\n    (\"영풍문고 신세계 센텀시티점\", [\"영풍문고 센텀\", \"영풍문고 신세계\"]),\n    (\"（주교보문고부산점\", [\"교보문고 부산\", \"교보문고\"]),\n    (\"반다이남코코리아\", [\"반다이남코코리아\", \"반다이남코\"]),\n]\n\nfor name, q_list in test_targets:\n    print(f\"\\n--- Testing target: {name} ---\")\n    found = False\n    for q in q_list:\n        results = search_bizno_exact(q)\n        for r in results:\n            d = get_bizno_detail(r['biz_no_10'])\n            if d:\n                print(f\"   Candidate: {d['title']} | Biz: {d['biz_no']} | CEO: {d['ceo']} | Emp: {d['emp_cnt']} | Addr: {d['addr'][:35]} | Status: {d['status']}\")\n                found = True\n        if found:\n            break\n    if not found:\n        print(\"   No candidate found on bizno.\")\n","Description":"Test bizno keyword variations for target subset","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\scratch\\test_keywords.py","toolAction":"Writing test script","toolSummary":"Write test_keywords.py"}}]}
